Read each source situation through the forward proposed mapping and then its documented reverse. Compare resulting obligations, actor roles, record identity and completion to the source situation. Any information lost on the forward leg cannot be recovered by guessing on return. Return concrete lost distinctions and critical unowned steps. A reversible syntax transform is insufficient where semantic meaning changed.
